<title>USA: N.D. Housing $15 million repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>N.D. Housing $15 million repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc repriced and restructured a $15 million North Dakota Housing Finance Agency offering, raising the top yield in 2028 to 6.15 percent from 6.10 percent.</p>
<p>STATE OF NORTH DAKOTA</p>
<p>RE: $15,000,000*</p>
<p>NORTH DAKOTA HOUSING FINANCE AGENCY</p>
<p>HOUSING FINANCE PROGRAM BONDS</p>
<p>HOME MORTGAGE FINANCE PROGRAM</p>
<p>1997 SERIES A</p>
<p>RECEIVED THE VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>			SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aa		    S&amp;P: NR</p>
<p>DATED: 12/01/1996</p>
<p>FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 01/01 &amp; 07/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
